By day, I run production operations at Big Slate Media in Knoxville, where I also work as a commercial photographer. The freelance photography you see on this site, the elopements, the personal work, the adventures, is a separate thing. It's the photography I for my personal enjoyment.

My personal work happens anywhere. I'm always looking for opportunities to take my camera with me, whether it's quick day trip or a family holiday. I'm constantly drawn to the natural beauty of our surroundings and love to capture the moments we spend in them as a family.
